d":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"V_S54QGnokLMshOm8xNTag","review_id":"2QUiGfCQa90a2nzu_lSzuw","date":"2016-02-19T20:13:14","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9409477710723877,"text_excerpt":"Went to the Audubon Clubhouse Cafe on a sunny Saturday for brunch and had an amazing time. The large white and green \"house\" is hidden a little off the road on Magazine street. Tons of parking, relaxing pond and beautiful gardens surround the cafe. The view is stunning - glass windows and doors encircle the dinning area enticing observation of tee offs. The grounds are absolutely spectacular. There is also outdoor seating on the ample, wrap around veranda complete with towers of fire heating units for chilly days. On to the food which is superb. The brunch menu featured so many great offerings, it was hard to narrow the field and choose. Absolutely going back to try more dishes. We ultima..."},{"business_id":"V_S54QGnokLMshOm8xNTag","review_id":"ma5M6SMlliXXOx5VLp5kqQ","date":"2016-08-16T02:53:29","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9381879568099976,"text_excerpt":"Tried their new dinner menu and it was a good experience. I had the skirt steak with grits for my entree. Also tried the fish, and the risotto with crab. We got the boudin balls and oysters w/okra appetizers. Everything was really good, but also really rich. They bring you complimentary bread with whipped butter and an amuse-bouche. I got a go box for about half of my entree to save room for dessert, which was the Creme brûlée, and it was delightful. The food is a little pricey but it is worth it for the great view of the park."},{"business_id":"V_S54QGnokLMshOm8xNTag","review_id":"mvi8xtEsVn4DJFlrfBZDmw","date":"2011-05-17T15:35:01","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9291218519210815,"text_excerpt":"This was our first time going here and we were kind of impressed. For such a limited menu, they sure do each item to the fullest. The day we went here for lunch they had a shrimp and merlitone soup as a special. My husband and I shared that and it was delicious. I also ordered the salad with house made vinegarette (which was amazing). My hubby had the burger and a salad and the burger was just delicious!! Aside from the great food (despite the very limited menu options) the views of the golf course are so pretty and on a nice day, what's better than to eat, drink, and have great views while you're doing it! I will be going back here again."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"V_S54QGnokLMshOm8xNTag","photo_id":"xJ3aAvh-p1XJSCbEU1KI5A","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/xJ3aAvh-p1XJSCbEU1KI5A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8472693562507629},{"business_id":"V_S54QGnokLMshOm8xNTag","photo_id":"yhWg_HH4GFQR9bOdR-GAGA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/yhWg_HH4GFQR9bOdR-GAGA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8351956009864807},{"business_id":"V_S54QGnokLMshOm8xNTag","photo_id":"YA6PI_MMZjQI3m_PgJvTQQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/YA6PI_MMZjQI3m_PgJvTQQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7957980632781982},{"business_id":"V_S54QGnokLMshOm8xNTag","photo_id":"3IRNErl_2N62l9y8-nmTRA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/3IRNErl_2N62l9y8-nmTRA.jpg","visual_r